Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.96,0:00:03.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.43,0:00:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道怎么关闭地狱之门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured out how to close the gates of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.71,0:00:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,总体来说 上帝建立了一系列测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically, God built a series of tests,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.31,0:00:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你都完成了 就可以去关门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when you've done all three, you can slam the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.83,0:00:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你需要人帮忙 - 我要你安安全全的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You need backup. - No, I need you safe, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.71,0:00:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道结局怎样 我们其中一个要牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both know where this ends…one of us dies…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.02,0:00:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去做这些测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna do these trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.25,0:00:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要自己去做 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna do them alone … end of story.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你念咒语肯定没用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spell's not gonna work for you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.69,0:00:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我没能通过测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I didn't pass the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.89,0:00:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我通过了 剩下的都让我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did…and I'm doing the rest of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.05,0:00:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.66,0:00:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.06,0:00:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.92,0:00:39.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.71,0:01:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.85,0:01:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.20,0:02:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dang it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.53,0:02:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,调度中心 我是7M4 听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dispatch, seven-mary-four … you got your ears on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.11,0:02:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,请讲7M4\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, Seven-Mary-Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.92,0:02:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,89号公路有肇事逃逸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a hit and run on 89.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.07,0:02:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.25,0:02:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体状况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the condition of the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.97,0:02:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来冻僵了 请求建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like he's frozen solid. Please advise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,7M4请原地待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven-Mary-Four, please hold your position.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.14,0:02:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会派救护车前往你的方位\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll send an ambulance to your location.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.83,0:02:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.11,0:03:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第8季第16集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.99,0:03:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.25,0:04:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文有消息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard from Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.23,0:04:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no. Nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.28,0:04:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都三周了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it been, like, three weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.69,0:04:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,小天才怎么拖了这么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's taking that little brainiac so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.22,0:04:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是本书嘛 读就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a book. Read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.11,0:04:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我胡乱猜的 但是翻译上古文字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a guess, but translating an ancient language.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.46,0:04:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,又毫无辅助 恐怕比我们想的难\N{\fnArial\fs30}with zero help might be more difficult than we think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡没消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, no word from Cass,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.53,0:04:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文也在慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin's taking his sweet little time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.80,0:04:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又小心翼翼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're acting cagey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.55,0:04:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,再不来点什么我就要上墙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a lead before I start climbing these walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.76,0:04:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.89,0:04:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是这样 这儿有个僵尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}in that case, I can give you zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.94,0:04:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,肇事逃逸 死在路上 躺了一夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy gets hit by a car, left for dead overnight,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.79,0:04:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒了一地肠子肚子\N{\fnArial\fs30}guts spilled out all over the road,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.99,0:04:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后起身离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then gets up and walks away from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.65,0:04:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有吃脑子的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing about brain munching?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.06,0:04:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得鲍比的妻子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember Bobby's wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.06,0:04:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就没吃脑子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't… munch on any brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:04:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,证人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, who's the witness?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.20,0:05:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙大纳州警 20年老警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Montana state trooper, 20-year vet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.35,0:05:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查了脉搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Checked his pulse,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.49,0:05:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到他内脏撒了一地\N{\fnArial\fs30}saw his insides spilled out all over the place,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.78,0:05:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后宣布他已经死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}pronounced him dead with a capital "D."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.51,0:05:22.89,Note,0,0,0,0,,（蒙大纳州警 大瀑布警局）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.89,0:05:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,联调局怎么还追踪起僵尸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when have the Feds started tracking zombie activity?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.99,0:05:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不追踪僵尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't track zombie activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.49,0:05:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这世上没有僵尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}because there's no such thing as zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.78,0:05:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我们说说你都看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just tell us what you saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.48,0:05:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,报纸上都说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Article said it all …
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.79,0:05:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,死挺了 内脏撒了一地 脸冻僵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead as dog poop, guts pecked out, face frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.76,0:05:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能站起来就消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}People don't walk away from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.72,0:05:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有僵尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zombies do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.16,0:05:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得他可能是被什么东西拖走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't think something could have dragged him away?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.38,0:05:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一组脚印 没有拖动痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}One set of footprints, no drag marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没去追他 - 那儿有熊啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You didn't go after him? - That's grizzly country.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.78,0:05:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我再多钱我都不会进树林\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't pay me enough to hike those woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.41,0:05:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我个火箭炮差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}not without a bazooka.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.98,0:05:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Jack?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.97,0:05:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.35,0:06:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,利文斯顿那边的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came across the wire from Livingston.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.99,0:06:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,无名氏 疑被灰熊打死\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Doe … presumably mauled by a grizzly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.54,0:06:07.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（验尸报告）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.25,0:06:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap, that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.12,0:06:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个死人吗 - 死个球啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's the dead guy? - Dead my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.34,0:06:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个僵尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a zombie, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.22,0:06:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,警官先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you know what, trooper?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.39,0:06:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留在这儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.66,0:06:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去处理这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take care of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.57,0:06:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,得有人在这儿留守\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need someone to hold down the fort.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.41,0:06:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.74,0:06:25.27,Title,0,0,0,0,,如果真遇上《活死人黎明》（著名僵尸电影）了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and if things go all "Dawn of the dead" On us,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.43,0:06:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们肯定先找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be our first call.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.29,0:06:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.05,0:06:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aim for the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.50,0:06:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有身份证明吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No I.D. on this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.15,0:06:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,指纹也查不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fingerprints came up blank, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:48.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（蒙大纳 利文斯顿）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.65,0:06:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.08,0:06:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,肝脏被吃掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liver was eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.11,0:07:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜是成了鸟食了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best guess is a bird got at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.36,0:07:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得承认 我有点失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to say, I am a little disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.22,0:07:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 因为你想杀僵尸来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, 'cause you wanted to shoot zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.84,0:07:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然想杀僵尸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn straight I wanted to shoot some zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事再明白不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, this is about as open-and-shut as it gets, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.15,0:07:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙被车撞死 躺下睡了一觉 醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy gets mack-trucked, goes down for a nap, wakes up,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.99,0:07:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,绕了一圈进熊窝了 就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}takes a detour into mama bear's den … end of story.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.18,0:07:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他为什么要逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why would he run?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.22,0:07:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个警察本会帮他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That trooper could have helped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.48,0:07:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 有案底\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Shady past?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.60,0:07:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 有案底的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, don't guys with a shady past.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.82,0:07:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么指纹查不到东西啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}usually have a fingerprint on file?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.95,0:07:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他是什么 现在已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it was, the guy's dead now, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.26,0:07:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得鲍比的话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember what Bobby said, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.86,0:07:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,碎木机什么都能干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Wood chipper beats everything"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.44,0:07:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,灰熊也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, so does grizzly bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.74,0:07:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赶快给我交待\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better start talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.93,0:07:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.72,0:07:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是说僵尸 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you say, "Zombie, " I swear …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.52,0:07:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不 我什么都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?! No, I'm not anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,两分钟前 你是具室温的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, two minutes ago, you were room temperature.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.21,0:07:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定有蹊跷\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.05,0:07:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道我怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't know what I am, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.24,0:07:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道自己是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.17,0:07:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道我总是死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is all I do is die,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:08:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要想打死我 请便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so if you want to shoot me, shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.91,0:08:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是保证我你能做好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just promise me you finish the job,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.40,0:08:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是受不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I can't take this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.03,0:08:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 起来 站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Get up, get up, get up. Stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.76,0:08:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you do is die?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.26,0:08:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.69,0:08:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有记忆以来 每天都死一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once a day, for as long as I can remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.50,0:08:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,几小时后 我又活过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After a few hours, I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.60,0:08:23.03,Title,0,0,0,0,,你是活人版肯尼（动画片《南方公园》中的角色）吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, like a real-life Kenny?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.56,0:08:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.71,0:08:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我叫肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, my name is Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听着 肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, listen, Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.91,0:08:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能在这儿查明你的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna find out what the hell you are in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.50,0:08:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得跟我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you're gonna come with us, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.07,0:08:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会做些测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna run a few tests,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.31,0:08:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保你没什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure everything's kosher.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.57,0:08:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tests?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.28,0:08:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.45,0:08:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,联调局允许你们这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is FBI-sanctioned?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.47,0:08:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.35,0:08:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.22,0:08:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么长生不死有多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}how long has this dying thing been going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:08:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有记忆以来一直如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as I can remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.53,0:08:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我只记得几年内的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but my memory only goes back a few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.88,0:09:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有失忆症了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, so now you have amnesia?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.03,0:09:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道自己的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.22,0:09:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真名不叫肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}My real name isn't Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.54,0:09:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这名字是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was given to me because…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.04,0:09:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 我总得有个名字啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, people had to call me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.84,0:09:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那你是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So, then, what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.52,0:09:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在欧洲一座山上获救\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got pulled off a mountain in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.72,0:09:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,说是我遇到了一场雪崩\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said that I got caught in an avalanche.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.13,0:09:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,获救之前的事我都不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember anything from before the rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.98,0:09:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我意识到自己的状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I realized my condition,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.42,0:09:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我不能跟人接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I couldn't be around other people,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.81,0:09:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我造了栋小木屋 学习打猎 自己隐居\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I built a little cabin, learned to hunt, kept to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.49,0:09:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得这样好些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seemed easiest that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.82,0:09:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后几个种大麻的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then a couple pot growers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.93,0:09:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我离他们的大麻田太近而不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}grew nervous with me being so near their crop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.89,0:09:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是打死我两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shot me … twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.14,0:09:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就觉得我该换个地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured it was time to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.82,0:09:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跑到车轮子底下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right into the grille of that pickup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能洗洗澡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think maybe I could clean up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.46,0:09:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 请便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, man. Knock yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他绝对有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's definitely something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.23,0:09:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 但或许他并不坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but maybe he's not the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.13,0:09:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是个受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.29,0:09:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得是诅咒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thinking curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.60,0:09:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是巫师干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be looking for a witch, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.31,0:10:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.53,0:10:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他留在这儿很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's parked here. He's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.85,0:10:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们该再开间房查个明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should just get another room until we can figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.85,0:10:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但你去给他做腔肠检查找魔法袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, but you're the one going full-cavity for the hex bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.20,0:10:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.41,0:10:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.40,0:10:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.73,0:11:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在是你最可怕的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm your worst enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.02,0:11:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说她认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She … she said that she knew me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.98,0:11:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么个认识法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, how?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.47,0:12:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 但她知道我不认识她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, but, uh, I could have sworn that she was upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.24,0:12:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.42,0:12:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不止是诅咒那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is, uh … this is a lot more than a curse, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.49,0:12:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可挺厉害的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got, like, some tiger blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.57,0:12:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪学的功夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you learn that kung fu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.61,0:12:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.85,0:12:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.88,0:12:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得缓缓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I just need a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.62,0:12:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子没打过架呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been in a fight in my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.12,0:12:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, hey, hey, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Are you …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.64,0:12:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这是心脏病发了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he having a heart attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.68,0:12:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们报警吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we call 911?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.76,0:12:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tell them what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.49,0:12:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从停尸间偷来的死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That the dead guy we stole from the morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.27,0:12:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,活过来犯心脏病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is alive and having a coronary?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.25,0:12:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得自己像在服丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like I'm sitting shiva.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是…算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's not … never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…we need to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.38,0:12:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 有什么东西身手堪比杰森·伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what do we know of that has Jason Bourne fighting skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.05,0:12:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,成天死掉 还跟暴力女有段渊源\N{\fnArial\fs30}dies a lot, and has a history with violent women?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.93,0:12:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know … you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.31,0:13:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.96,0:13:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍汉姆特工吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Bonham?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.88,0:13:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.52,0:13:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这听起来会很怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna sound really strange,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.87,0:13:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我在找一具昨天失踪的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm looking for a corpse that went missing today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.03,0:13:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,验尸官说你们是最后见到他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The coroner said that you were the last one to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.18,0:13:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是海莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Hayley.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.90,0:13:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是琼斯特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, this is agent Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.67,0:13:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要找无名氏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you looking for our John Doe?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.85,0:13:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, his name is Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.32,0:13:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我这么喊他\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least, that's what I called him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.12,0:13:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是他孩子的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the mother of his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.20,0:14:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我拍个手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you, uh, slap me some skin, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.93,0:14:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很害羞\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.25,0:14:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 奥利弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, Oliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.52,0:14:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you weren't supposed to see …
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.26,0:14:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟这些好联调局特工待着 奥利弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with the nice FBI agents, Oliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.22,0:14:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我年轻的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was younger,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.52,0:14:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有些朋友想去欧洲爬一座山\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had friends that wanted to climb this mountain in Europe,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.01,0:14:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得挺好玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I thought it sounded exciting,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.53,0:14:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一起去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so…I joined them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.17,0:14:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪崩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The avalanche?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.28,0:14:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He … he told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.04,0:14:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.91,0:14:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只说他不记得自己怎么去的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just that he doesn't remember how he got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.09,0:14:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朋友都没影了 我找到他时\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends were gone, and when I found him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.53,0:14:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的衣服撕坏了 眼睛冻僵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}his clothes were torn off, his eyes were frozen solid,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.72,0:14:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he was still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.53,0:15:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道他有什么不对劲的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just knew there was something off about him,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.24,0:15:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}the way that…he would …
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.03,0:15:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天都死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.93,0:15:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.87,0:15:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为他是休克了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was from exposure or shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.83,0:15:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,昏迷不醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he was unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.57,0:15:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当时状况都很差\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were both in bad shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.53,0:15:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know I couldn't have made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.46,0:15:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己肯定不能走下山\N{\fnArial\fs30}down the mountain if it weren't for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.54,0:15:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们走到山下时 我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when we got to the bottom, we, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.79,0:15:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,意识到我们的感情已经有了变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}realized that it had become something else,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.96,0:15:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就在一起过了一夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we spent the night together,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.27,0:15:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在一起的时候 他突然心脏病发\N{\fnArial\fs30}and while we were, you know… he had a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.30,0:15:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,尴尬啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.40,0:15:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我报了警 他们不能救活他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I called 911, and they couldn't save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.19,0:15:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只好去认尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I had to go down to I.D. The body…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.86,0:15:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他却又坐起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He popped up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.77,0:15:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,活过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.98,0:15:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吓坏了 跑掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I freaked out. And I ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.76,0:15:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,九个月后我生下了奥利弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nine months later, I had Oliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.74,0:15:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我雇了个私家侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hired a private investigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.33,0:15:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的努力找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really tried to find him,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.42,0:16:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们放弃后 我也放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but when they gave up, I gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.68,0:16:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到几个月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until a couple of months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.32,0:16:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么又开始找了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what made you look again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.07,0:16:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,最可怕的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worst thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.45,0:16:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,海莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hayley?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.78,0:16:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥利弗 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oliver, come here, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.37,0:16:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你们该见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was time you two meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.33,0:16:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是奥利弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Oliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.00,0:17:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.30,0:17:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.95,0:17:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似诅咒的事被我们说中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we were right about that curse thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.69,0:17:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切证据表明 他是个泰坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what I can tell, we're looking at a titan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.75,0:17:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰坦 那是神祇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A titan? What is that … like, a god?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.84,0:17:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该说是神的原型机\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like a proto-god,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.69,0:17:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,神之前的神\N{\fnArial\fs30}like the gods before the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.69,0:17:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们曾统治希腊\N{\fnArial\fs30}They ruled over Greece.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.45,0:17:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但后来被宙斯和其他奥利匹亚神推翻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}before Zeus and the rest of the Olympian gods overthrew them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.34,0:17:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这家伙是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.83,0:17:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,依我推测\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best I can tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.02,0:17:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是普罗米修斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prometheus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.42,0:17:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是吧 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seriously? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.81,0:17:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是偷了圣火还是什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, didn't he … he steal fire or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.10,0:17:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.75,0:17:36.67,Title,0,0,0,0,,他跑去奥林匹斯山上玩《十一罗汉》\N{\fnArial\fs30}He, uh, "ocean's eleven'd" mount Olympus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.67,0:17:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,并盗走了奥林匹亚之火\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stole the flames of Olympia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.64,0:17:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了找刺激吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what, kicks?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.10,0:17:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上是为了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}For us, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.35,0:17:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯剥夺了人类造火的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeus decided to revoke humanity's ability to make fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.29,0:17:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无法烧饭 无法取暖\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we couldn't cook, couldn't stay warm,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.99,0:17:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法照明\N{\fnArial\fs30}couldn't see in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.60,0:17:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来很糟糕啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like a monster's paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.83,0:17:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙帮了我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this guy made it right for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.08,0:17:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.29,0:17:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in return,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.07,0:17:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯把他绑在那座山上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeus decided to strap him to that mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.08,0:17:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他每天都死一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make him relive death every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.54,0:18:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 每天这样过了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn. Every day for how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.87,0:18:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪他疯掉了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder the guy's hard drive is fried.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.29,0:18:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你查到扮成战神西娜的是谁了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you figure out who, uh, Xena-wannabe was?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.43,0:18:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜是阿耳特弥斯 宙斯的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing Artemis, Zeus' daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.51,0:18:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她携带那把匕首那样的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been known to carry around weapons like that dagger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.51,0:18:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西很厉害 能杀死不死之身\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're nasty. They'll kill immortals dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.78,0:18:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.90,0:18:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没对付过神的诅咒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we've never battled a god curse before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.29,0:18:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望能打破它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope we can break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.34,0:18:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一只鹰在啃食你的内脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an eagle chowing down on your intestines.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.30,0:18:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't remember that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.54,0:18:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.37,0:18:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look, I hate to break it to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.71,0:18:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你是普罗米修斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you are Prometheus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.30,0:18:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我最好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, the best thing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.29,0:18:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量远离他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to get as far away from them as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.29,0:18:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.30,0:18:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚发现自己有个七岁大的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just discovered that you have a seven-year-old son,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.37,0:18:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你第一反应是跑路吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you want to walk away?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.57,0:18:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是个神\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.95,0:18:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个神和他女儿在找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this god and his daughter are hunting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.81,0:18:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有活路吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What chance do I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.81,0:18:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.33,0:18:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna help you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.76,0:18:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们得制定个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we need a plan first,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.29,0:18:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这儿是想不出的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we can't come up with one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.97,0:18:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.08,0:18:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,去个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someplace safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.30,0:19:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.30,0:19:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他摔倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.09,0:19:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我叫救护车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I need to call an ambulance?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.30,0:19:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.06,0:19:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要死了 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dying, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.94,0:19:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was going to tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.93,0:19:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想给你点时间接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted you to have a chance to adjust.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.78,0:19:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 他继承了你的诅咒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second … he has your curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.30,0:19:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}What curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.37,0:19:34.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（堪萨斯 黎巴嫩）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.94,0:19:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他放在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just put him right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,诅咒是针对你的 他怎么也有\N{\fnArial\fs30}This curse was put on you. Why the kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.54,0:19:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.54,0:19:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在说什么诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep saying "Curse." What curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.05,0:19:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事有多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long has this been happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.21,0:19:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个月前他满七岁时开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, I … since he turned seven a few months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.71,0:19:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他先是不停死去 然后还不说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It started with the dying, and then he stopped talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,七岁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, seven?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.07,0:19:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,七岁是希腊第一次成年的标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Age seven marks one of the first Greek rites of manhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.29,0:20:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 这个诅咒成了内置程序了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? Are you saying the curse is hardwired into his programming?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.11,0:20:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.22,0:20:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.85,0:20:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉我当年撇下了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry that I ran out on you all those years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.21,0:20:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.18,0:20:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't understand what was going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.09,0:20:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是我们的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.18,0:20:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你有什么 他遗传到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and whatever you have, he has.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.21,0:20:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得知道怎么阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know how to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.09,0:20:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}What curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.39,0:20:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥利的爸爸是个希腊神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so Ollie's dad is a Greek God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.09,0:20:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯诅咒他每天都要死一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}who has been cursed to die every day by Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.33,0:20:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩是驱鬼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you guys are…ghostbusters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.57,0:20:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听错了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I getting this right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.28,0:20:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,鉴于你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, due to the fact that your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.13,0:20:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前 尽管只是暂时 死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is currently, albeit temporarily, dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.33,0:20:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不跟你计较了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna let that one slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.64,0:20:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to realize this sounds crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.67,0:20:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.65,0:20:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一开始也不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't believe it myself at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.98,0:20:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只有这样才说得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's the only thing that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.61,0:20:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早点接受这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the faster you wrap your brain around this,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.84,0:20:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能早点解决问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}the faster we can solve the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.35,0:20:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solve the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.16,0:20:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道我有没有理解问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'm just not even sure I understand the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.28,0:20:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.02,0:21:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常我们的做法是 召唤这混蛋过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the way we usually handle this is we summon the bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.07,0:21:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不断折磨他 直到他撤销诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we work him over until he undoes whatever it is he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.53,0:21:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,召唤宙斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Summon Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.58,0:21:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.70,0:21:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他不肯撤销呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he doesn't want to undo it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.04,0:21:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.61,0:21:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望诅咒会随他一起消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}And hopefully, the curse dies along with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.56,0:21:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会发生这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.69,0:21:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我能处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}This I can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.17,0:21:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以一辈子逃亡 躲避 死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you can run and hide and die for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.61,0:21:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.24,0:21:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我和萨姆会去找宙斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Sam and I are gonna go after Zeus…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.77,0:21:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来不来都无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}With or without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.80,0:21:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.54,0:22:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.54,0:22:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.54,0:22:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙的阴茎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dragon penis.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.74,0:22:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.80,0:22:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个叫龙根的古希腊猎魔人写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ancient Greek hunter by the name of Drakopoolos.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.93,0:22:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我看来 他是个狠角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Near as I can tell, he was a badass.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.71,0:22:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便一说 他的名字是希腊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose name, incidentally, is Greek …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.56,0:22:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了 我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. I got that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.64,0:22:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 干得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.93,0:22:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the, uh… is the kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.06,0:22:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.64,0:22:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,请继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please, keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.67,0:22:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前 龙根和宙斯干了一架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, so, uh, Drakopoolos tangled with Zeus back in the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.64,0:22:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,记录者翻译了他的日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the men of letters translated his journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.30,0:22:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The men of letters?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.88,0:22:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个神秘团体\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a secret society.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.08,0:22:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就是他们的基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is actually their lair.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.31,0:23:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是传人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're legacies.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.01,0:23:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么大不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.80,0:23:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.86,0:23:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里写着 他将宙斯召唤进一个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it says here he summoned Zeus into a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.57,0:23:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了杀他的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}and found out how to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.45,0:23:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.62,0:23:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,被闪电击中的树木\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wood from a tree struck by lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.81,0:23:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,要召唤宙斯需要两件东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it says we need two things for the summon …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.90,0:23:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯手上冻住的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}frozen energy from the hand of Zeus,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.15,0:23:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及其信徒的尸骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the bone of a worshipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.15,0:23:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,冻住的能量 是闪电熔岩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frozen energy … you thinking fulgurite?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.16,0:23:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很合理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.70,0:23:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.07,0:23:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上网查一下 附近有没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get on the web, see if there's any Greeks nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.73,0:23:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在膜拜上古之神的希腊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that are still worshipping the Old Gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.00,0:23:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上查\N{\fnArial\fs30}On it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.03,0:23:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那木头呢 容易找吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-what about the wood? Is that easy to find?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.41,0:23:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要点运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a little bit of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.71,0:23:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 日记就这么断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait … t-this journal just ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.51,0:23:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.37,0:23:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么知道那个龙什么的有没有活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how do we know if Drako-whatever survived?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.80,0:23:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯有没有报复他\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we know Zeus didn't get to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.33,0:23:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.77,0:23:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么知道这方法有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we know this is going to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.47,0:23:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从来都不确定 不过这些书\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never know for sure, but these books …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.22,0:23:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般都挺靠谱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're, uh, they're pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.69,0:23:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就把命交给一个叫什么阴茎的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we're hanging our lives on the writings of a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.70,0:24:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,写的书吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}who…is named after genitalia.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.04,0:24:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字翻得不太准确\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a loose translation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.29,0:24:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Experts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.84,0:24:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 听听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.09,0:24:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,隔两个镇就有希腊异教徒 最棒的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greek pagans two towns over. Best part?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.34,0:24:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有个记载墓地的讣告页\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have an obit page with cemeteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.71,0:24:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.84,0:24:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩去挖坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are on grave duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.08,0:24:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来搞定B&E\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll handle the B&E.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.37,0:24:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.60,0:24:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,B&E 是指私闯民宅吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}B&E? You mean, breaking and entering?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.90,0:24:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.20,0:24:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,书里说我们需要闪电熔岩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the book calls for fulgurite.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.91,0:24:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺难弄到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little hard to come by.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.56,0:24:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次要用这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last time we needed it,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.42,0:24:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是从一个富翁那偷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we, uh, stole it from a one-percenter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.36,0:24:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道所有卖水晶的店\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do know that fulgurite is available.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.35,0:24:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有卖闪电熔岩的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}in crystal shops all over, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.23,0:24:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.79,0:24:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,新新人类用闪电熔岩来做廉价首饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new age people, they use it to make cheap jewelry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.80,0:25:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这么做 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.23,0:25:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要骨头 所以得挖坟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a bone, so I dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.49,0:25:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是说这么帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.23,0:25:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不关你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.92,0:25:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却拿自己的命冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're risking your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.43,0:25:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么拿自己的命冒险盗火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you risk yours to steal that fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.51,0:25:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.97,0:25:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜我记不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish I could remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.83,0:25:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 这是值得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me on this … it was worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.62,0:25:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差不多拯救了全世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pretty much, uh, saved the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.35,0:25:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.54,0:25:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果我不能救我儿子 那一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}But none of that … none of that means anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.52,0:25:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,都毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless I can save my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.97,0:26:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这一切看起来不太靠谱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I know this all seems a little haphazard, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.46,0:26:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你相信我 我和萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}But trust me when I say that me and Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.04,0:26:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有更没把握最终还是致胜的时候呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}have gone in with a lot less and come out on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.28,0:26:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.70,0:26:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.43,0:26:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要恳求希腊神祇宙斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm about to ask Zeus, the Greek god,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.09,0:26:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,治好我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help cure my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.46,0:26:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing you got to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.39,0:26:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是要求他帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}is this is not about asking for his help, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.21,0:26:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是你朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.84,0:26:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他得做他该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about getting him to do what's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.10,0:26:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.07,0:27:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.34,0:27:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不能有点礼貌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't we do this civilized?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.30,0:27:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这得看你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it depends on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.74,0:27:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只需要你解除一个孩子身上的诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we need is to break a curse you put on a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.19,0:27:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就痛快答应了 我们好各回各家\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how about you say, "Yes, " and we all go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.25,0:27:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见到你很高兴 普罗米修斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to see you again, Prometheus.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.88,0:27:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,都收拾干净了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All cleaned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.01,0:27:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在到处找你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.65,0:27:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太过分了 宙斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gone too far, Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.22,0:27:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,解除诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break the curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.07,0:27:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的儿子受了诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your child who has the affliction.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.19,0:27:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.40,0:27:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.67,0:28:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是好好配合 还是我们来硬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The easy way or we could do this the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.80,0:28:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开陷阱我就打破诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break the trap, dear man, and I'll break the curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.52,0:28:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没门\N{\fnArial\fs30}No dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.31,0:28:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,治好那孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fix the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.39,0:28:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going once…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.58,0:28:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别犯傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.03,0:28:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,两次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going twice…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.14,0:28:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你烂在这儿我都不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you can rot here for all I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.90,0:28:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 那孩子就要继续受折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and the child will continue to suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.37,0:28:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.73,0:28:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要我 你很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs me, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.97,0:28:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.38,0:28:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,海莉 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hayley, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.36,0:28:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now save my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.85,0:28:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.79,0:29:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来硬的好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we try this the hard way?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.89,0:29:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,把孩子带过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring forth the child.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.30,0:29:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有请了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.62,0:29:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.06,0:29:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们见过我女儿了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you've met my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.79,0:29:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,海莉不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hayley, don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.78,0:29:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是普罗米修斯的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the son of Prometheus.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.97,0:29:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他受了诅咒 要每天都死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's cursed to suffer death every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.62,0:29:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得承认 我从没想要这么可爱的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must admit, I could never have conceived such a horrible fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.10,0:30:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,遭受这么可怕的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}for such a beautiful child.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.69,0:30:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就证明了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just goes to show,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.03,0:30:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,总要为可喜的意外做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}we must all leave room for happy accidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.12,0:30:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思 我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean? I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.98,0:30:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.88,0:30:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,普罗米修斯看到过孩子死去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has Prometheus experienced the child's death yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.11,0:30:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他什么反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did he take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.59,0:30:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他痛苦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.72,0:30:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.16,0:30:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象你一千个孩子同时死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine a thousand children all dying in unison.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.48,0:30:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样你才会理解我的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only then would you understand my pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.50,0:30:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但人不能总是如愿 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can't always have what we want, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.22,0:30:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就用这一个将就吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…one will have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.41,0:30:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.05,0:31:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有件特别的任务交给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a special job for you, my little friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.03,0:31:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿耳特弥斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Artemis.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.31,0:31:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.19,0:31:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道现在领我们去赴死的是谁吗 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you know who this is, Dean, walking us to our deaths?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.41,0:31:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know. Don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.40,0:31:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们的神 阿耳特弥斯 猎神\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our god, Artemis … the goddess of hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.77,0:31:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有意思啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.78,0:31:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们猎杀蛇发女怪和牛头怪时\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, she's who we'd pray to for courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.48,0:31:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要祈祷她赐我们勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}when hunting the gorgon or the Minotaur.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.59,0:31:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过她现在已经不值得我们崇拜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, she's not really worship worthy anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.44,0:31:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她已经大不如前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, having lost a step and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.89,0:31:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.57,0:31:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你不是吧 跟神撂狠话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, Sam? Trash-talking a god?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.68,0:31:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有搞错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.39,0:31:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们能不能弥补一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, let's see if we can make up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.12,0:31:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这七年的时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}for seven years of lost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.34,0:32:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还像以前一样厉害吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still at full power? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.25,0:32:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么花了七年才找到普罗米修斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why did it take you seven years to track down Prometheus?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.71,0:32:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在躲着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.90,0:32:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiding from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.80,0:32:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎神居然找不到蒙大纳的小木屋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the god of hunters couldn't find a shack in montana?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.17,0:32:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你根本不想找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's that you didn't want to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.21,0:32:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, Sam, you're doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.33,0:32:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲会杀了那孩子的 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad's gonna kill that kid, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.57,0:32:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.02,0:32:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会再活过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.76,0:32:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unlike you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.71,0:32:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爱上你了 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was in love with you, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.83,0:32:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.90,0:32:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.33,0:32:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, sure, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.40,0:32:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱信不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.03,0:32:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.40,0:32:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别昏过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't pass out on me just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.03,0:33:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这才刚开始呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm only just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.10,0:33:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对你说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he say to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.75,0:33:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是他第一次逃离那座山\N{\fnArial\fs30}This wasn't the first time he escaped that mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.38,0:33:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你答应放他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that you let him go free,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.38,0:33:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,条件是他不把约会的事告诉你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}as long as you could hide your little tryst from the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.86,0:33:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他才不会这么说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.58,0:33:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他大脑一片混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}His brain is mush.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.12,0:33:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 那我是怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? Then how did I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.81,0:33:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉过其他人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, have you spilled it to anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.41,0:33:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,荷马 赫西奥德（希腊诗人） 希罗多德（史学家）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homer? Hesiod? Herodotus?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.69,0:33:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.07,0:33:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怕你父亲会发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were afraid big daddy would find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.57,0:33:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱上了这个世界上他最恨的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you fell for the person he hates most in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.32,0:33:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 当他看到那篇僵尸的报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, when he saw the zombie article,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.95,0:33:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论多么心痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It kind of forced your hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.14,0:33:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都必须来除掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you had to come hunt him down no matter how much it hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.04,0:33:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尽管下手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.35,0:33:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.02,0:33:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你父亲杀了那个男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let your father slaughter that boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.13,0:33:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次又一次地杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.27,0:33:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,连疤痕都不会留\N{\fnArial\fs30}That won't leave a mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.28,0:33:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢永生 对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like being an immortal, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.88,0:34:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你每天都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sure, you die every day,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.22,0:34:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没有东西可以让你一直死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}but nothing can keep you dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.28,0:34:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就像是打盹一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost like taking a little nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.52,0:34:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的焦心和顾虑会暂时消失一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of your cares and worries disappear for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.10,0:34:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,该睡觉了 乖孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's sleepy time, my dear boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.52,0:34:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这必须停下 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has to stop, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.42,0:34:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.80,0:34:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才刚刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm only just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.50,0:34:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做的够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.07,0:34:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是为了我们和其他神祇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am doing this for us…for our kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.99,0:34:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为他 我们虽然在世 却无法统治世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is the reason we're here and not ruling the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.72,0:34:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为他 世人遗忘了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the reason they have forgotten all about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.02,0:34:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,放他们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.81,0:34:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,放他们都走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.56,0:35:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你父亲 你要服从我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am your father, and you will obey me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.11,0:35:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾是我的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were once my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.40,0:35:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你只是个陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.11,0:35:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着你死去 我从不觉得烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never get tired of watching you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.11,0:35:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的孩子要上山了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your boy is going on the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.48,0:37:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.82,0:38:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.18,0:38:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去买一些圣代冰淇淋怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we go get some ice-cream sundaes?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.79,0:38:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.85,0:38:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.45,0:38:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬那捉摸不定的爱情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here's to that crazy little wild card called love.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.53,0:38:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道阿耳特弥斯爱上了普罗米修斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know Artemis had the hots for Prometheus, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.20,0:38:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.44,0:38:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.49,0:38:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 无论是什么 那还算挺有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, whatever it was, it worked…pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.68,0:39:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少那孩子没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least the kid's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.36,0:39:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.68,0:39:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始觉得也许我是天真了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starting to think maybe I was being naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.15,0:39:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.05,0:39:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说认为我自己可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I said that I could just will myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.49,0:39:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫发无损地通过那三项测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}into coming out of these trials unscathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.03,0:39:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.74,0:39:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要这样闷闷不乐 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop with the sullen emo crap, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.23,0:39:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会像普罗米修斯那样死去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's…you're not gonna die like Prometheus.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.33,0:39:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.03,0:39:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 鲁弗斯 现在是普罗米修斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, Rufus, now Prometheus…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.59,0:39:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他们有谁选择了死去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think any of them chose death?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.31,0:39:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.66,0:39:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是命运替他们做了选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}The life chose for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.09,0:39:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但你答应过 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you promised, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.22,0:39:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你答应我会过再正常不过的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promised to live a long, Clark Griswold life.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.90,0:39:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会去做前列腺和结肠镜检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}full of prostate exams and colonoscopies, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.57,0:39:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别想食言 我不允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not welshing on that deal, not on my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.59,0:39:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就算死 也得是自然死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you die, it's gonna be because of something normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.84,0:39:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如突发心脏病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a heart attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.92,0:39:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.79,0:39:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快吃汉堡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, eat your burger.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.38,0:40:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 你在听吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, you got your ears on?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.73,0:40:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不是个爱祈祷的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you know I am not one for praying,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.52,0:40:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为对我来说 那无异于恳求\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause in my book it's… it's the same as begging.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.19,0:40:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这和萨姆有关 所以你得听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is about Sam, so I need you to hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.51,0:40:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完全不了解情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going into this deal blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.41,0:40:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't know what's ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.40,0:40:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者萨姆会遇到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}or what it's gonna bring for Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.64,0:40:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他虽然藏得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, he's covering pretty good,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.72,0:41:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道他很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I know that he is hurting,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.81,0:41:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这些本该由我来承受\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this one was supposed to be on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.76,0:41:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 看在我们这么多年来的份上\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, for all that we've been through,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.83,0:41:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking you…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.12,0:41:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾一下我弟弟 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you keep a lookout for my little brother, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.65,0:41:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在哪 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are you, man?
